<h3 id="pagination-props" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#pagination-props"><span>Pagination Props</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>属性</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>默认值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>total(<strong>必填</strong>)</td>
<td>数据总数</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>current(<strong>v-model</strong>)</td>
<td>当前页数</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>default-current</td>
<td>默认当前页数</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>1</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>page-size(<strong>v-model</strong>)</td>
<td>每页条数</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>default-page-size</td>
<td>默认每页展示的数据条数(非受控状态)</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>10</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>hide-on-single-page</td>
<td>只有一页时是否隐藏分页</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>simple</td>
<td>是否使用简洁模式</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>show-total</td>
<td>是否展示总数</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>show-more</td>
<td>是否展示更多按钮</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>show-jumper</td>
<td>是否展示跳转输入框</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>show-page-size</td>
<td>是否展示每页条数选择器</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>page-size-options</td>
<td>每页条数选择器选项</td>
<td><code v-pre>number[]</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>[10, 20, 30, 40,50]</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>page-size-props</td>
<td>每页条数选择器属性</td>
<td><code v-pre>SelectProps</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>size</td>
<td>尺寸</td>
<td><code v-pre>Size</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>medium</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>page-item-style</td>
<td>分页按钮样式</td>
<td><code v-pre>CSSProperties</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>active-page-item-style</td>
<td>当前分页按钮样式</td>
<td><code v-pre>CSSProperties</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>base-size</td>
<td>计算显示省略的基础个数，显示省略的个数为<code v-pre>baseSize+2*bufferSize</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>6</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>buffer-size</td>
<td>显示省略号时，当前页码左右显示的页码个数</td>
<td><code v-pre>number</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>2</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>auto-adjust</td>
<td>是否在改变数据条数时自动调整页码</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>true</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="pagination-events" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#pagination-events"><span>Pagination Events</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
